      "text": "How Constrained Decoding Works (Allow-List vs. Ban-List)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How Constrained Decoding Works (Allow-List vs. Ban-List)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a5",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "7cf59d94-0c4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 612.56,
      "height": 105.30000000000001,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 98177,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 684301908,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794769811304,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Raw logits = ~151,936 unnormalized scores (one per vocab token).\n• Why -math.inf? After softmax, e^(-inf) = 0 -> physically unpickable.\n• Allow-List (Name, Bool, Num): start with [-inf]*V, copy only legal logits.\n• Ban-List (String): copy real logits, set banned_strings to -inf.\n• Model STILL decides: among surviving legal tokens, argmax picks the winner\n  based on Qwen's own weights (zero 'if keyword in prompt' heuristics).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Raw logits = ~151,936 unnormalized scores (one per vocab token).\n• Why -math.inf? After softmax, e^(-inf) = 0 -> physically unpickable.\n• Allow-List (Name, Bool, Num): start with [-inf]*V, copy only legal logits.\n• Ban-List (String): copy real logits, set banned_strings to -inf.\n• Model STILL decides: among surviving legal tokens, argmax picks the winner\n  based on Qwen's own weights (zero 'if keyword in prompt' heuristics).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a6",
      "autoResize": true
    },
