      "text": "Layer 1 & Layer 2: Why Output JSON is 100% Valid",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layer 1 & Layer 2: Why Output JSON is 100% Valid",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a8",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6af8cc67-525",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 604.5,
      "height": 105.30000000000001,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#052e16",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 65912,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1206526828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794769811304,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Guarantee 1 (Per-Token Value Validity): Every value hole is filled by\n  a dedicated selector constraining tokens to the parameter's schema type.\n• Guarantee 2 (Whole-File Structural Validity): The model NEVER emits\n  structural punctuation ({, }, :, ,) or parameter keys. Python builds\n  a native dict and serializes it with json.dump() in __main__.py.\n• Worst case: model picks a suboptimal value (accuracy), never broken JSON.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Guarantee 1 (Per-Token Value Validity): Every value hole is filled by\n  a dedicated selector constraining tokens to the parameter's schema type.\n• Guarantee 2 (Whole-File Structural Validity): The model NEVER emits\n  structural punctuation ({, }, :, ,) or parameter keys. Python builds\n  a native dict and serializes it with json.dump() in __main__.py.\n• Worst case: model picks a suboptimal value (accuracy), never broken JSON.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a9",
      "autoResize": true
    },
