      "updated": 1794789382548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• select_function_name() encodes\n  all registry keys into token seqs\n• Step 1: allows 'fn'\n• Step 2: allows '_add', '_greet'...\n  Logits pick '_add'\n• Step 3: allows '_numbers' -> wins\n• Step 4: is_complete=True -> allows\n  closure '\"' -> model picks '\"'\n• Result: 'fn_add_numbers'",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• select_function_name() encodes\n  all registry keys into token seqs\n• Step 1: allows 'fn'\n• Step 2: allows '_add', '_greet'...\n  Logits pick '_add'\n• Step 3: allows '_numbers' -> wins\n• Step 4: is_complete=True -> allows\n  closure '\"' -> model picks '\"'\n• Result: 'fn_add_numbers'",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aJ",
      "autoResize": true
    },
