      "text": "• spec.parameters['a']['type']\n  is 'number'\n• select_number_value() allows:\n  digits '0-9-.', stops '},'\n• Pass 1: model picks '2'\n• Pass 2: model picks ',' (stop)\n• Pipeline casts float('2') -> 2.0\n• Python appends ', \"b\": '",
