      "versionNonce": 1079938004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794769811310,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. src/__main__.py (CLI & Batch Runner)\n   • Parses --functions_definition, --input, --output via argparse.\n   • Catches FileNotFoundError, json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError, KeyboardInterrupt.\n   • Instantiates Small_LLM_Model() once; isolates per-prompt errors in try/except.\n\n2. src/models.py & src/registry.py (Pydantic Schema Enforcement)\n   • FunctionSpec(BaseModel): name, description, parameters, returns.\n   • Validates list structure; skips individual bad entries with a warning.\n\n3. src/prompt.py (ChatML Formatter)\n   • Rejects empty prompts (ValueError). Lists signatures + Python regex hints.\n   • Guides accuracy (which option to pick), never relied upon for JSON syntax.\n\n4. src/pipeline.py (Two-Stage Generator & BPE Ratchet)\n   • Avoids forward passes on static JSON tokens (~5-15 calls vs ~40+ naive).\n   • Unknown parameter types safely default to None; number ValueError -> 0 / 0.0.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. src/__main__.py (CLI & Batch Runner)\n   • Parses --functions_definition, --input, --output via argparse.\n   • Catches FileNotFoundError, json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError, KeyboardInterrupt.\n   • Instantiates Small_LLM_Model() once; isolates per-prompt errors in try/except.\n\n2. src/models.py & src/registry.py (Pydantic Schema Enforcement)\n   • FunctionSpec(BaseModel): name, description, parameters, returns.\n   • Validates list structure; skips individual bad entries with a warning.\n\n3. src/prompt.py (ChatML Formatter)\n   • Rejects empty prompts (ValueError). Lists signatures + Python regex hints.\n   • Guides accuracy (which option to pick), never relied upon for JSON syntax.\n\n4. src/pipeline.py (Two-Stage Generator & BPE Ratchet)\n   • Avoids forward passes on static JSON tokens (~5-15 calls vs ~40+ naive).\n   • Unknown parameter types safely default to None; number ValueError -> 0 / 0.0.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ae",
      "autoResize": true
    },
