      "updated": 1794769811310,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• function_name.py (Prefix Trie Walk)\n  Builds valid_sequence = [encode(k) for k in registry]. At step t, allows\n  seq[t] for matching prefixes; adds closure '\"' when is_complete=True.\n  Raises ValueError on empty registry.\n\n• boolean.py (One-Shot Binary Mask)\n  Single forward pass. Masks all tokens except true_id and false_id to -inf.\n\n• number.py (Character-Class Allow-List)\n  Allows single-char tokens in '0123456789-.' + stop tokens '}' and ','.\n  Loops up to max_digits=20; breaks on stop token.\n\n• string.py (Ban-List + Soft Drift + Loop Detection)\n  - Hard bans: '\"', '\\n', '\\r', curly quotes (close_hammer '\"' preserved).\n  - Soft terminators (banned_drifts): '{', '}', '\\'', '.', '\\\\', '\\n', 'regex',\n    'replacement', 'source_string' -> breaks loop if emitted after >=1 token.\n  - _would_repeat(): checks periodic cycles of length 1..6 to halt loops.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• function_name.py (Prefix Trie Walk)\n  Builds valid_sequence = [encode(k) for k in registry]. At step t, allows\n  seq[t] for matching prefixes; adds closure '\"' when is_complete=True.\n  Raises ValueError on empty registry.\n\n• boolean.py (One-Shot Binary Mask)\n  Single forward pass. Masks all tokens except true_id and false_id to -inf.\n\n• number.py (Character-Class Allow-List)\n  Allows single-char tokens in '0123456789-.' + stop tokens '}' and ','.\n  Loops up to max_digits=20; breaks on stop token.\n\n• string.py (Ban-List + Soft Drift + Loop Detection)\n  - Hard bans: '\"', '\\n', '\\r', curly quotes (close_hammer '\"' preserved).\n  - Soft terminators (banned_drifts): '{', '}', '\\'', '.', '\\\\', '\\n', 'regex',\n    'replacement', 'source_string' -> breaks loop if emitted after >=1 token.\n  - _would_repeat(): checks periodic cycles of length 1..6 to halt loops.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ah",
      "autoResize": true
    },
