      "versionNonce": 940616788,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794769811310,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Honest Tradeoffs & Optimization Opportunities:\n• Regex / Escaping Tradeoff: string.py bans '.' and '\\\\' in banned_drifts to\n  prevent JSON drift, which can truncate complex regexes early. Pipeline also\n  cleans double backslashes via raw_value.replace('\\\\\\\\', '\\\\').strip().\n• Vocab Scan Cost: _load_banned_string_tokens() & _load_structural_drift_tokens()\n  re-read vocab.json (~151k tokens) per string call -> caching sets at startup\n  is an immediate speedup.\n• No KV-Cache Exposed: SDK runs full forward pass O(n^2) per token; skipping\n  model calls on injected JSON syntax keeps total runtime < 15s (GPU) / < 1m (CPU).\n\nQuick Defense Checklist:\n• Why decode->re-encode? Prevents non-canonical BPE boundary token splits.\n• Why -inf over -1e9? Softmax(-inf) = exact 0; finite penalties could still win.\n• Who picks the function? The LLM's logits among trie-valid branches.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Honest Tradeoffs & Optimization Opportunities:\n• Regex / Escaping Tradeoff: string.py bans '.' and '\\\\' in banned_drifts to\n  prevent JSON drift, which can truncate complex regexes early. Pipeline also\n  cleans double backslashes via raw_value.replace('\\\\\\\\', '\\\\').strip().\n• Vocab Scan Cost: _load_banned_string_tokens() & _load_structural_drift_tokens()\n  re-read vocab.json (~151k tokens) per string call -> caching sets at startup\n  is an immediate speedup.\n• No KV-Cache Exposed: SDK runs full forward pass O(n^2) per token; skipping\n  model calls on injected JSON syntax keeps total runtime < 15s (GPU) / < 1m (CPU).\n\nQuick Defense Checklist:\n• Why decode->re-encode? Prevents non-canonical BPE boundary token splits.\n• Why -inf over -1e9? Softmax(-inf) = exact 0; finite penalties could still win.\n• Who picks the function? The LLM's logits among trie-valid branches.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ak",
      "autoResize": true
    }
